{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_047_01_b",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:76d6e85695af13fcb8c6dbc4d6bde0b9bc2f0b36dcc489d0969434fb947b47ea",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_01_1_2_047_01:1_2_047_01_b:cmd-000012:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:712857884e9772364fa0f58e2925e1a65b77eb2b3e9c197d4bdbedf8a0f285b9",
      "text": "这个游戏是回合制战斗。\n把你新手教程抽到的角色给我看看。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_01_1_2_047_01:1_2_047_01_b:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b19ab27ce06e73c9c909c00eca5d2ef7d7074390e384f53096275c95b09a2546",
      "text": "……手气挺不错的嘛。按喜欢的角色来选也是一种办法，\n但一开始还是均衡选择属性会比较有利。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_01_1_2_047_01:1_2_047_01_b:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6537dc761151bb024f047d5affa6dbdb9067a390a235254c4db63865a43a6ae0",
      "text": "新手的话，推荐这个和这个的搭配。\n就算是忙碌的你，也能在短时间内培养起来。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_01_1_2_047_01:1_2_047_01_b:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0d15073d2e4d47d91cc8466ee3bd774e20e3450b83ab66543ae1fb0d27f651c1",
      "text": "非常感谢！\n秀先生推荐的角色，好可爱啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_01_1_2_047_01:1_2_047_01_b:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9afc5b878506b5485c97f7002f36e4d4adf9ec92c5a1e1d8d53a342be719b422",
      "text": "秀先生平时都用什么角色呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_01_1_2_047_01:1_2_047_01_b:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ac9f2da7657c876598542127bde4fe11745f10099fdd756d4ef956fef4cd0fc6",
      "text": "最常用的是这个。虽然是个年纪跟我差不多的男角色。\n但性格超级有攻击性，挺有意思的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_01_1_2_047_01:1_2_047_01_b:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f45ba2b34c14fbdd469a0218a5f320ad082658b0a14ec133d56624b4f97d8779",
      "text": "不过，他有自己明确的原则。\n是个讲道理、很帅气的家伙哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_01_1_2_047_01:1_2_047_01_b:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7ba427b2a618e8c3da226b4297f34ce38bfa035b1e29e8dda28ae630fd36b3cf",
      "text": "而且在全角色里也是顶级的力量数值。\n只要上了增益就能靠蛮力碾压获胜，所以效率很高。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_01_1_2_047_01:1_2_047_01_b:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:398a306f3c0bbb7679ef61db09cfe77358795f6ab9bceb6e257b3fa690adf5a7",
      "text": "虽然我也喜欢制定策略去战斗，\n但赶时间的时候就特别喜欢用这个角色吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_01_1_2_047_01:1_2_047_01_b:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:716ef3b65f2681ad035571267179d84fa10fd82a8b10f1340fa611144aaea88f",
      "text": "原来如此！是会根据不同场合，\n来分别使用不同的角色呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_047shu_01_1_2_047_01:1_2_047_01_b:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:942811f5c1be8bce6c7115a9d5ee6d7043cdc8a5c82805f6bd1fc42857a4d2da",
      "text": "谢谢你。我会参考你教给我的内容，\n试着去组建卡组的！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
